    "title": "MAPP Technologies to Host Career Fair on June 20 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Erin Slifka ,\n1 days ago (Joplin, MO) – Looking for more than just a job? Are you looking for a career?. Join MAPP Technologies and build a career in aerospace manufacturing! Learn more about them at their Career Fair on Saturday, June 20. From 9:00 am to 1:00 pm, come meet their team, tour their facility (1927 W. 4th Street), learn about current opportunities, and interview on-site. Read full article",
